WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:18.013
Tom walked along the path in the Dark Forest.

2
00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:27.413
The forest was spooky.

3
00:00:27.414 --> 00:01:05.339
"Where is the palace?" thought Tom.

4
00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:11.174
Tom saw a peddler.

5
00:01:11.175 --> 00:01:16.191
"Do you know where the palace is?" asked Tom.

6
00:01:16.192 --> 00:01:19.451
"Yes," said the peddler.

7
00:01:19.452 --> 00:01:28.125
"It's where it always is, you fool!"

8
00:01:28.126 --> 00:01:33.730
"What a rude man," thought Tom.

9
00:01:33.731 --> 00:01:37.470
Tom walked some more.

10
00:01:37.471 --> 00:01:41.635
But he still did not see the palace.

11
00:01:41.636 --> 00:01:45.292
He pulled out the map.

12
00:01:45.293 --> 00:01:49.822
Suddenly a cold wind blew.

13
00:01:49.823 --> 00:01:53.262
"Brr!" Tom shivered.

14
00:01:53.263 --> 00:01:56.258
He reached into his sack.

15
00:01:56.259 --> 00:02:03.188
He found his mittens.

16
00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:09.258
But where was his fur hat?

17
00:02:09.259 --> 00:02:13.689
"I will make a new hat appear!" said Tom.

18
00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.872
He pointed his wand at his head.

19
00:02:16.873 --> 00:02:19.780
"Fur hat!" he said.

20
00:02:19.781 --> 00:02:35.577
Poof! Poof! Poof!

21
00:02:35.578 --> 00:02:40.221
Now something warm and furry sat on his head!

22
00:02:40.222 --> 00:02:44.810
"I did it!" Tom said proudly.

23
00:02:44.811 --> 00:02:48.447
Just then the cold wind blew again.

24
00:02:48.448 --> 00:02:51.463
The map flew out of Tom's hands!

25
00:02:51.464 --> 00:02:56.203
The map flew off the path and through the trees.

26
00:02:56.204 --> 00:02:59.231
Tom gulped.

27
00:02:59.232 --> 00:03:03.997
"Master said to stay on the path," thought Tom.

28
00:03:03.998 --> 00:03:06.818
"But I need that map!"

29
00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:14.359
Nervously Tom stepped off the path.

30
00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:22.788
He went deeper and deeper into the forest.

31
00:03:22.789 --> 00:03:26.714
Suddenly Tom stopped.

32
00:03:26.715 --> 00:03:28.941
"Huh?" he said.

33
00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:30.980
He felt his head.

34
00:03:30.981 --> 00:03:36.707
His fur hat was moving!
